---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Miranda · Services · UX & Product Consulting"
  description="Fixed timelines, declared outputs, explicit anti-scope. Process discovery, workflow design, UX architecture, software selection, QA and adoption."
  page="services-en"
  bg='data-max="120" data-link="150" data-accent="0.09" data-speed="0.13"'
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="lead-2col" style="align-items:center;">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow reveal">Services</div>
          <h1 class="reveal d1">A structured system, not a list of services.</h1>
          <p class="reveal d2">Each service is a point in the same system: understand the process, make the right decision, design for adoption, maintain quality. You enter where you need to.</p>
          <div class="cta-row reveal d3">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg magnetic" href="https://calendly.com/mirandauxdesigner/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i data-lucide="calendar-check" class="ic"></i> Book a triage call</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal d2">
          <div class="orbit-wrap">
            <div class="ring"></div><div class="ring r2"></div><div class="ring r3"></div>
            <div class="spin">
              <div class="orbit-node" style="transform:translate(0,-200px)"><i data-lucide="route" class="ic"></i><b>Process</b><small>as-is / to-be</small></div>
              <div class="orbit-node" style="transform:translate(195px,40px)"><i data-lucide="box" class="ic"></i><b>Software</b><small>real fit</small></div>
              <div class="orbit-node" style="transform:translate(-30px,195px)"><i data-lucide="users-round" class="ic"></i><b>Adoption</b><small>roadmap</small></div>
              <div class="orbit-node" style="transform:translate(-200px,30px)"><i data-lucide="clipboard-check" class="ic"></i><b>UX QA</b><small>pre-release</small></div>
            </div>
            <div class="orbit-core"><div><b>Defensible<br>decision</b><small>core</small></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIERS -->
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="shell">

      <!-- ENTRY -->
      <div class="tier-head reveal">
        <span class="tnum">01</span><h3>Entry</h3>
        <span class="tdesc">Where most engagements start. Decision and alignment, before spending.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="offers">
        <div class="offer feat reveal d1">
          <span class="flag">Core</span>
          <div class="tier">Decision sprint</div>
          <h3>Software Fit Sprint</h3>
          <p>Select, validate or discard a software decision starting from real operational processes, not vendor demos.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>€1,500</b><span>fixed · 2 weeks</span></div>
          <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">What's included and what's not <i data-lucide="chevron-down"></i></button>
          <div class="detail"><div class="detail-inner">
            <div><h5>Includes</h5><ul>
              <li>as-is and to-be process map</li><li>bottleneck identification</li>
              <li>UX-driven selection criteria</li><li>shortlist of 2-3 solutions or validation of one</li>
              <li>decision matrix with pros, cons, costs, limits and risks</li><li>adoption roadmap</li>
            </ul></div>
            <div class="exc"><h5>Not included</h5><ul>
              <li>technical development or configuration</li><li>vendor negotiation</li>
              <li>implementation PM</li><li>ongoing support</li>
            </ul></div>
          </div></div>
          <a class="arrow" href="https://calendly.com/mirandauxdesigner/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a triage call <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
        <div class="offer reveal d2">
          <div class="tier">Entry</div>
          <h3>Website Evolution &amp; Adoption Check</h3>
          <p>Find out whether a recent site is still supporting the business and what to evolve over the next 3-6 months, without rebuilding everything.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>€1,200</b><span>fixed · 1 week</span></div>
          <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">What's included and what's not <i data-lucide="chevron-down"></i></button>
          <div class="detail"><div class="detail-inner">
            <div><h5>Includes</h5><ul>
              <li>UX and business audit</li><li>real usage analysis, when data is available</li>
              <li>gap analysis</li><li>evolution roadmap</li><li>what to do, what not to do, what to defer</li>
            </ul></div>
            <div class="exc"><h5>Not included</h5><ul>
              <li>full redesign</li><li>development</li><li>extensive content production</li><li>SEO or advertising</li>
            </ul></div>
          </div></div>
          <a class="arrow" href="https://calendly.com/mirandauxdesigner/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Send the link + objective <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
        <div class="offer reveal d3">
          <div class="tier">Design</div>
          <h3>Custom software design</h3>
          <p>Turn complex processes into software designed on real workflows, with clear requirements and acceptance criteria, before writing code.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>Quoted</b><span>after triage call</span></div>
          <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">What's included and what's not <i data-lucide="chevron-down"></i></button>
          <div class="detail"><div class="detail-inner">
            <div><h5>Includes</h5><ul>
              <li>as-is and to-be process map</li><li>user flows and functional architecture</li>
              <li>prioritised functional requirements</li><li>wireframes or conceptual prototype</li>
              <li>acceptance criteria for the dev team</li><li>phased handoff and roadmap</li>
            </ul></div>
            <div class="exc"><h5>Not included</h5><ul>
              <li>technical development</li><li>dev team management</li>
              <li>code maintenance</li><li>user helpdesk</li>
            </ul></div>
          </div></div>
          <a class="arrow" href="https://calendly.com/mirandauxdesigner/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a triage call <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- UPSELL -->
      <div class="tier-head reveal">
        <span class="tnum">02</span><h3>Targeted upsells</h3>
        <span class="tdesc">When the decision is made and you need to remove friction at a specific point.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="offers">
        <div class="offer reveal d2">
          <div class="tier">Upsell</div>
          <h3>CRO / Adoption Sprint</h3>
          <p>Improve conversion or adoption by removing measurable friction from one funnel or feature at a time.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>€3,500</b><span>indicative</span></div>
          <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">What's included and what's not <i data-lucide="chevron-down"></i></button>
          <div class="detail"><div class="detail-inner">
            <div><h5>Includes</h5><ul><li>friction mapping</li><li>qualitative and quantitative evidence, when available</li><li>prioritised backlog</li><li>test plan</li><li>success criteria</li></ul></div>
            <div class="exc"><h5>Not included</h5><ul><li>ongoing CRO</li><li>campaign management</li><li>technical implementation</li></ul></div>
          </div></div>
          <a class="arrow" href="/en/contact">Bring 1 funnel or feature <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RECURRING -->
      <div class="tier-head reveal">
        <span class="tnum">03</span><h3>Recurring</h3>
        <span class="tdesc">Quality continuity, always working with the same person, without endless retainers.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="offers grid-2cols">
        <div class="offer reveal d1">
          <div class="tier">Recurring</div>
          <h3>UX/UI QA &amp; Functional Testing</h3>
          <p>I test real flows and edge cases before releases, so fewer experience bugs reach production.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>€800</b><span>/ month · 3-6 months</span></div>
          <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">What's included and what's not <i data-lucide="chevron-down"></i></button>
          <div class="detail"><div class="detail-inner">
            <div><h5>Includes</h5><ul><li>UX/UI flow testing</li><li>functional testing from the user perspective</li><li>release report with severity and priority</li><li>UX checklist</li></ul></div>
            <div class="exc"><h5>Not included</h5><ul><li>security testing</li><li>performance and load testing</li><li>automation</li></ul></div>
          </div></div>
          <a class="arrow" href="https://calendly.com/mirandauxdesigner/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start a pilot month <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
        <div class="offer reveal d2">
          <div class="tier">Premium</div>
          <h3>Light UX / QA retainer</h3>
          <p>A lightweight monthly UX decision and QA presence for teams that want continuity without hiring.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>€1,500</b><span>/ month · 6 months</span></div>
          <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">What's included and what's not <i data-lucide="chevron-down"></i></button>
          <div class="detail"><div class="detail-inner">
            <div><h5>Includes</h5><ul><li>recurring UX reviews</li><li>light QA on agreed releases or features</li><li>decision support</li><li>shared UX standards</li></ul></div>
            <div class="exc"><h5>Not included</h5><ul><li>unlimited design production</li><li>helpdesk</li><li>full PM replacement</li></ul></div>
          </div></div>
          <a class="arrow" href="/en/contact">Assess the retainer fit <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- DEV PARTNER -->
      <div class="tier-head reveal">
        <span class="tnum">04</span><h3>Dev partnerships</h3>
        <span class="tdesc">A clear collaboration model with agencies and developers.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="offers" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;">
        <div class="offer reveal d1" style="max-width:none;">
          <div class="tier">Channel</div>
          <h3>Dev partner collaboration</h3>
          <p>A collaboration model where I handle the decision, UX quality and handoff, and the partner manages delivery. Clear roles, less rework, more client confidence.</p>
          <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">What's included and what's not <i data-lucide="chevron-down"></i></button>
          <div class="detail"><div class="detail-inner" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;display:grid;gap:24px;">
            <div><h5>Includes</h5><ul><li>handoff standards</li><li>shared offer model</li><li>role clarity</li><li>referral or revenue share model</li></ul></div>
            <div class="exc"><h5>Not included</h5><ul><li>technical delivery</li><li>full sales management for the partner</li></ul></div>
          </div></div>
          <a class="arrow" href="/partner">Propose a partnership <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="cta-band reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow center" style="justify-content:center;">Not sure where to start?</div>
        <h2 style="margin-top:14px;">Start with a triage call.</h2>
        <p>Tell me what you're trying to decide. I'll point you to the right service, or tell you I'm not the right fit and who might help you better.</p>
        <div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg magnetic" href="https://calendly.com/mirandauxdesigner/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i data-lucide="calendar-check" class="ic"></i> Book a triage call</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
